        schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-supercritical-pitchfork-mean-curvature-h-w-tilde-kappa-0-correlation-across-w-tilde-in-0-5-10-reference> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-liang-chiral-seed-pod-opening-measurement-supercritical-pitchfork-mean-curvature-h-w-tilde-kappa-0-correlation-across-w-tilde-in-0-5-10-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
